---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다 | 케이비(주) KB Inc."
  description="요청하신 페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다."
  noindex
>
  <section class="border-b border-hairline-steel relative overflow-hidden">
    <div class="absolute top-0 right-0 w-1/2 h-full bg-graphite-surface opacity-40 -skew-x-12 translate-x-1/3 pointer-events-none"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-container mx-auto px-gutter py-section-v flex flex-col items-start gap-6" data-reveal>
      <p class="font-mono text-[13px] text-arterial-red flex items-center gap-3"><span class="w-8 h-px bg-arterial-red"></span>404 / NOT FOUND</p>
      <h1 class="font-display font-bold text-bright-alloy tracking-tightest text-[clamp(2.2rem,5vw,3.6rem)] leading-[1.1]">
        <span data-ko-only>페이지를 찾을 수 없습니다</span><span data-en-only>Page not found</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="text-muted-zinc text-lg max-w-2xl leading-relaxed">
        <span data-ko-only>주소가 바뀌었거나 삭제된 페이지입니다. 아래 메뉴에서 원하시는 내용을 찾아보세요.</span>
        <span data-en-only>The page may have moved or no longer exists. Try one of the links below.</span>
      </p>
      <div class="flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 mt-2">
        <a href="/" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 bg-arterial-red text-bright-alloy font-mono text-[13px] px-6 py-3 hover:bg-arterial-red-dim active:translate-y-px transition-all">
          <span data-ko-only>홈으로</span><span data-en-only>HOME</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-[16px]">arrow_forward</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/products" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-hairline-steel text-muted-zinc font-mono text-[13px] px-6 py-3 hover:border-arterial-red hover:text-bright-alloy transition-colors">
          <span data-ko-only>제품소개</span><span data-en-only>PRODUCTS</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/contact" class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 border border-hairline-steel text-muted-zinc font-mono text-[13px] px-6 py-3 hover:border-arterial-red hover:text-bright-alloy transition-colors">
          <span data-ko-only>연락처</span><span data-en-only>CONTACT</span>
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
